{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026o9n85gKaQL1792880945.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>天氣概況：受乾燥的東北季候風影響，今明兩日廣東天色普遍晴朗。隨著季候風補充逐漸影響華南沿岸，本周中期該區風勢較大，雲量逐漸增多。此外，熱帶氣旋薔琵會在今日橫過東海及逐步減弱，隨後移向日本九州一帶並逐漸演變為溫帶氣旋。</p><p></p><p>本港地區今日天氣預測：天晴乾燥。日間市區最高氣溫約31度，新界再高一兩度。吹和緩北至東北風。</p><p></p><p>展望：明日大致天晴。隨後一兩日風勢較大，雲量逐漸增多。</p><p></p><p>05:45 更新</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T23:20:13.601872+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":192,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T22:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T08:40:32.584838+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T23:18:07.276601+00:00","content_hash":"ffcb40d8208f76b35449650a5b130cdc8f74bff765ea153bd18e30d74a0d6d62","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-24T23:20:13.601872+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}